# The image is built from the project root (runner/Dockerfile COPYs runner/,
# box/ and spike/). Allowlist: only those three folders enter the build
# context, so secrets, TLS material, .env, tests, .venv and spike results never
# can.
*
!runner/
!box/
!spike/

# …and not their caches or local leftovers.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/results/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/tls/
**/.env
**/.env.*
